The film is a follow-up to Moore's Fahrenheit 9/11 (2004), a
documentary about the presidency of George W.

12
01:30:21,176 --> 01:30:27,176
The film had its world premiere on September 6, 2018, at the 2018 Toronto International Film Festival,
and was released in the United States on September 21, 2018, by Briarcliff Entertainment.

13
01:37:52,941 --> 01:37:58,941
